# Dataset Source and Setup

## Dataset
Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset by Olist

## Source
Kaggle: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/olistbr/brazilian-ecommerce

## Download Instructions
1. Open the Kaggle dataset link above.
2. Sign in to your Kaggle account.
3. Click **Download** to download the dataset as a ZIP file.
4. Extract the ZIP file on your local machine.
5. Create a MySQL database named `olist_ecommerce`.
6. Follow the instructions in the project's README to import the required CSV files into MySQL Workbench.

## Data Availability
The raw CSV files are not included in this repository. Users must download the dataset directly from Kaggle.

